{"model":"nomic-embed-text:latest","input":["search_document: Community library members renew access cards at the main desk each spring.","search_document: Members may reserve the quiet study room for two-hour blocks.","search_document: After-hours entry requires a current access card and the west door code.","search_document: community library access: the library garden volunteers meet on the first Saturday.","search_document: community library access: the story hour cart keeps picture books in blue bins.","search_document: community library access: the local history shelf receives a weekly newspaper.","search_document: community library access: the printer room posts an unrelated paper limit.","search_document: community library access: the makerspace stores spare solder in a locked drawer.","search_document: community library access: the reading lamps use a separate replacement schedule.","search_document: community library access: the community room has another reservation calendar.","search_document: community library access: the book drop is emptied before the morning opening.","search_document: community library access: the volunteer desk maintains a different contact list.","search_document: community library access: the children room displays an unrelated craft schedule.","search_document: community library access: the archive cabinet contains a separate donor index.","search_document: community library access: the cafe kiosk closes for an unrelated cleaning cycle.","search_document: community library access: the public computers use a different session timeout."],"truncate":false}